555
01:36:31,518 --> 01:36:35,518
Three sons by the sword of the Mongols.

556
01:36:35,518 --> 01:36:41,008
They killed my lineage.
What is this taxing news?

557
01:36:41,538 --> 01:36:46,168
What does it mean to be a
vassal of the Mongols?

558
01:36:54,920 --> 01:36:59,300
I did it to break their alliance
with Nikola.

559
01:36:59,667 --> 01:37:05,697
If we were to fight with Togay
as well..

560
01:37:06,958 --> 01:37:11,438
