my brother Savcı.

561
01:37:12,626 --> 01:37:19,346
You say that it's a plan of yours.

562
01:37:19,346 --> 01:37:23,346
Did I get it right, Osman Bey?

563
01:37:24,266 --> 01:37:31,086
Instead of trading with Nikola, you sent
Malhun Hatun and her alps to me.

564
01:37:31,086 --> 01:37:35,086
It helped us.

565
01:37:36,032 --> 01:37:40,032
That's what fits you, Umur Bey.

566
01:37:40,032 --> 01:37:44,032
But Nikola will seek revenge.

567
01:37:44,668 --> 01:37:49,638
But Togay will stop Nikola
because of the taxes.

568
01:37:53,319 --> 01:37:59,239
This plan will be a secret
between you and I.

569
01:38:00,078 --> 01:38:03,738
No one will know it.

570
01:38:03,738 --> 01:38:08,688
Don't worry, Osman Bey.
We know how to keep a secret.

571
