to keep it a secret.

574
01:38:29,590 --> 01:38:34,830
My daughter Malhun came to your aid
without my order.

575
01:38:35,658 --> 01:38:39,658
-You didn't order it?
-No.

576
01:38:39,658 --> 01:38:45,578
