578
01:39:27,429 --> 01:39:32,959
Do you Mongols always abandon
your allies on the battlefield?

579
01:40:12,409 --> 01:40:18,579
With Geyhatu's order, now I'm the
lord of the Ilkhaganete's border.

580
01:40:18,579 --> 01:40:22,579
Everything of the Turk tribes; their blood
their bone, their flesh, their taxes...

581
01:40:22,579 --> 01:40:27,699
