You betrayed me.

589
01:41:19,495 --> 01:41:25,335
But you haven't seen the
real treachery yet.

590
01:41:25,837 --> 01:41:32,487
Osman will betray you so bad that
you will come here to...

591
01:41:32,487 --> 01:41:35,187
