but the wrath of Ilkhaganate.

594
01:41:46,684 --> 01:41:52,434
We'll see. It won't take long.
We will see.

595
01:41:52,434 --> 01:41:58,914
Not only Osman. Umur Bey too will
be under my protection.

596
01:41:58,914 --> 01:42:02,914
Those who don't listen to my word will...

597
01:42:02,914 --> 01:42:07,874
