01:57:17,197 --> 01:57:22,907
He worked with Geyhatu to protect
his soldiers.

738
01:57:23,078 --> 01:57:27,618
Let's see if Osman sends us money...

739
01:57:28,592 --> 01:57:31,132
or head.

740
01:57:35,400 --> 01:57:39,400
Malhun Hatun was about to
spoil all of my works.

741
01:57:40,625 --> 01:57:43,915
I had to send her.

742
01:57:44,370 --> 01:57:47,400
What did you do?
Is my daughter safe?

743
01:57:47,459 --> 01:57:52,529
Don't worry, my Bey. She is with the Alps.

744
01:57:53,148 --> 01:57:56,178
They will meet the other
Alps on their way.

745
01:57:56,386 --> 01:57:57,426
Good.

746
01:57:58,433 --> 01:58:03,153
She should learn some things
if she rules this tent.

747
01:58:03,364 --> 01:58:07,214
You can't be a Bey just by fighting.

748
01:58:07,944 --> 01:58:15,414
You will use your mind and
you should be patient.

749
01:58:17,133 --> 01:58:22,163
- Can I come in, Umur Bey?
- Come in, Oman Bey.

750
01:58:27,399 --> 01:58:29,649
Welcome.

751
01:58:30,365 --> 01:58:31,905
Umur Bey...

752
01:58:33,538 --> 01:58:35,758
Malhun Hatun is in my tent.

753
01:58:36,329 --> 01:58:38,429
In your tent?

754
01:58:39,625 --> 01:58:42,525
What is she doing there?

755
01:58:42,718 --> 01:58:45,328
Don't blame her.

756
01:58:45,847 --> 01:58:50,167
- I stopped her from going.
- Why did you do that?

757
01:58:51,174 --> 01:58:54,584
It's not the right thing to punish her.

758
01:58:54,628 --> 01:58:58,128
It's between me and my daughter.

759
01:58:58,181 --> 01:59:01,211
You stay out of it.

760
01:59:01,377 --> 01:59:05,307
How can you disobey my order?

761
01:59:05,454 --> 01:59:09,604
She helped me.

762
01:59:09,936 --> 01:59:13,776
So, it's also about me!

763
01:59:14,420 --> 01:59:20,180
Do you think I will stay out of it while
she is being punished like this?

764
01:59:20,362 --> 01:59:26,702
You think you can do anything you want.

765
01:59:27,386 --> 01:59:30,676
Don't you see that you discredit me?

766
01:59:30,806 --> 01:59:35,246
Then, you won't let your daughter go...

767
01:59:35,431 --> 01:59:38,971
if you don't want to be discredited.

768
01:59:40,213 --> 01:59:43,793
How do you know if Nikola
does something bad?

769
01:59:43,827 --> 01:59:48,397
There's no danger for us.
We have an agreement with Nikola.

770
01:59:48,496 --> 01:59:53,006
- What agreement is that again?
- A new caravan is in İnegöl.

771
01:59:54,411 --> 01:59:57,721
Malhun Hatun will pay for her manners.

772
01:59:57,795 --> 02:00:01,625
- You stay out of it, Osman Bey!
- Umur Bey!

773
02:00:01,664 --> 02:00:04,184
Can I come in?

774
02:00:04,283 --> 02:00:06,693
Yes.

775
02:00:09,100 --> 02:00:13,650
My Bey, Nikola sen this.

776
02:01:07,794 --> 02:01:10,124
What is written on that?

777
02:01:12,045 --> 02:01:14,445
What is written on that?

778
02:01:20,451 --> 02:01:22,061
These heads are the...

779
02:01:22,773 --> 02:01:25,873
consequences of what Malhun did.

780
02:01:27,502 --> 02:01:32,692
They say they can start the trade now.

781
02:01:32,767 --> 02:01:37,327
Nikola may do something bad to
Malhun Hatun and...

782
02:01:37,389 --> 02:01:40,879
he may say it's revenge for Kalanoz.

783
02:01:42,139 --> 02:01:47,449
She isn't going to Engürü.

784
02:02:21,386 --> 02:02:24,696
Umur Bey has his Alps heads.

785
02:02:26,850 --> 02:02:33,000
Send my regards to
Umur Bey, a proud Turk Bey.

786
02:02:38,196 --> 02:02:42,496
No one can harm me
without paying for what they did.

787
02:03:17,483 --> 02:03:22,983
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim. (In the name of Allah, the Compassionate, the Merciful.)

788
02:03:31,754 --> 02:03:34,724
Enjoy it.

789
02:03:50,443 --> 02:03:55,273
You talked to my father, Osman Bey.
What happened?

790
02:03:58,244 --> 02:04:00,764
I talked to Umur Bey.

791
02:04:00,890 --> 02:04:04,210
I said it's dangerous.

792
02:04:05,522 --> 02:04:07,522
He agreed.

793
02:04:10,029 --> 02:04:11,949
Then?

794
02:04:14,348 --> 02:04:17,548
You aren't going to Engürü.

795
02:04:24,402 --> 02:04:27,692
I wasn't expecting him to agree.

796
02:04:27,760 --> 02:04:32,050
He knew he was wrong.

797
02:04:32,272 --> 02:04:34,822
Then...

798
02:04:35,977 --> 02:04:39,187
you can go to your tent tomorrow.

799
02:04:43,332 --> 02:04:48,022
- I owe you, Osman Bey.
- Not at all.

800
02:04:53,903 --> 02:04:56,073
Come on, enjoy your meals.

801
02:05:13,509 --> 02:05:17,509
Mashallah.

802
02:05:18,066 --> 02:05:22,466
May Allah bless your hands, my Bala.
The rice is so delicious.

803
02:05:35,005 --> 02:05:38,315
Malhun Hatun did it, Osman Bey.

804
02:06:06,979 --> 02:06:10,119
- Can I come in, my Bey?
- Come in.

805
02:06:14,827 --> 02:06:20,327
- Malhun Hatun is going to her tent.
- Thanks.

806
02:06:23,384 --> 02:06:26,064
Can I come in, Osman Bey?
- Come in, brother.

807
02:06:33,622 --> 02:06:37,712
- I have some important news, Osman Bey.
- Tell me, brother.

808
02:06:38,011 --> 02:06:41,621
Togay has more 100 soldiers now.

809
02:06:46,235 --> 02:06:48,675
100 soldiers, huh?

810
02:06:50,389 --> 02:06:53,339
They are the best soldiers.

811
02:06:58,115 --> 02:07:01,325
It's complicated, Osman Bey.

812
02:07:02,742 --> 02:07:05,242
Togay is very powerful.

813
02:07:12,046 --> 02:07:13,566
And...

814
02:07:18,455 --> 02:07:21,715
today is the tax day.

815
02:07:29,269 --> 02:07:33,809
He will attack us
when he doesn't get money.

816
02:07:50,033 --> 02:07:52,403
It seems so.

817
02:07:52,902 --> 02:07:56,112
They seem so powerful.

818
02:07:56,976 --> 02:07:59,786
They will cause trouble to us.

819
02:08:01,254 --> 02:08:05,254
My Bey, what if you continue your trick...

820
02:08:06,074 --> 02:08:08,844
you give some money and...

821
02:08:09,866 --> 02:08:13,136
get Togay off of us?

822
02:08:24,824 --> 02:08:27,314
What do you think, brother?

823
02:08:27,578 --> 02:08:31,408
We couldn't beat them yet.

824
02:08:32,974 --> 02:08:37,304
We know what Balgay did to our tent.

825
02:08:39,192 --> 02:08:41,632
Then...

826
02:08:43,072 --> 02:08:47,072
we should decide
which of them is more harmful.

827
02:08:50,192 --> 02:08:54,262
Money or defeat?

828
02:09:06,573 --> 02:09:11,203
The ambassador you've sent
has arrived in the tent, Togay.

829
02:09:11,417 --> 02:09:15,807
In these lands that Ertuğrul
Bey took from Byzantine...

830
02:09:16,115 --> 02:09:20,865
Geyhatu is the only ruler.

831
02:09:22,412 --> 02:09:27,162
The spirits are with me.

832
02:09:28,480 --> 02:09:32,480
The power of Erlik Khan is with me.

833
02:09:32,729 --> 02:09:35,179
I am still suspicious of Osman.

834
02:09:37,200 --> 02:09:40,520
Do you think I am trapped by Gökbörü?

835
02:09:42,007 --> 02:09:44,717
Whether he will send the golds...

836
02:09:45,227 --> 02:09:49,997
or his tent will be covered by blood.

837
02:10:17,326 --> 02:10:18,536
What do you want?

838
02:10:18,680 --> 02:10:22,280
I am the ambassador of Commander Togay.

839
02:10:22,537 --> 02:10:24,567
I will meet Osman Bey.

840
02:10:25,970 --> 02:10:28,890
Alps, search him up.

841
02:10:44,922 --> 02:10:47,192
Look at his head.

842
02:10:57,636 --> 02:10:59,066
Come on.

843
02:11:23,619 --> 02:11:26,879
- Can I come in, my Bey?
- Come in.

844
02:11:36,804 --> 02:11:39,574
I am here to take the money.

845
02:11:42,855 --> 02:11:44,685
Welcome.

846
02:11:45,838 --> 02:11:47,648
Welcome.

847
02:11:48,689 --> 02:11:50,889
We were waiting for you.

848
02:11:54,050 --> 02:11:55,590
Göktuğ.

849
02:11:57,598 --> 02:12:02,948
Bring the golds that Togay wants.

850
02:12:03,470 --> 02:12:05,290
Okay, my Bey.

851
02:12:08,725 --> 02:12:11,475
You seem ready.

852
02:12:11,675 --> 02:12:13,965
We don't like being late.

853
02:12:14,684 --> 02:12:16,374
Thank you.

854
02:12:20,015 --> 02:12:23,175
Can I come in?

855
02:12:23,435 --> 02:12:25,685
Come in, Bamsı Bey.

856
02:12:39,389 --> 02:12:42,739
How is Togay?

857
02:12:43,477 --> 02:12:47,757
He is better now.

858
02:12:52,409 --> 02:12:54,049
Mashallah.

859
02:12:54,766 --> 02:12:56,766
Mashallah.

860
02:13:14,909 --> 02:13:16,039
Here...

861
02:13:23,615 --> 02:13:26,795
these are from my grandfather
Suleyman Shah's victories.

862
02:13:41,882 --> 02:13:43,762
These are from...

863
02:13:44,971 --> 02:13:47,861
my father Ertuğrul Ghazi's victories.

864
02:14:01,996 --> 02:14:04,766
My nephew Bayhoca's blood...

865
02:14:06,875 --> 02:14:09,515
is on these golds.

866
02:14:14,458 --> 02:14:18,458
My brother Savcı Bey...

867
02:14:18,549 --> 02:14:24,279
Abdurrahman Ghazi and all of the martyrs...

868
02:14:26,631 --> 02:14:29,701
has their blood on these golds.

869
02:14:47,997 --> 02:14:49,497
Now...

870
02:14:54,862 --> 02:14:58,322
you want to take these golds...

871
02:14:59,620 --> 02:15:01,080
right?

872
02:15:06,689 --> 02:15:08,559
You can.

873
02:15:09,880 --> 02:15:11,610
Here you go.

874
02:16:25,156 --> 02:16:27,876
Taking money from Turks is like...

875
02:16:29,164 --> 02:16:34,454
taking the lion's hunting.

876
02:17:03,652 --> 02:17:05,822
Tell Togay that...

877
02:17:08,051 --> 02:17:13,481
Kayı Tent never gives money.

878
02:17:50,111 --> 02:17:53,271
This is what a coyote...

879
02:17:53,660 --> 02:17:55,520
gets from the lion.

880
02:17:56,118 --> 02:18:18,208
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com